{"arguments":{"end_line":120,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/abandoned/fix-chat-auth-location/proposal.md","start_line":1},"at":"2026-11-05T14:59:25.165696+00:00","call_id":"call_DRxBTPfgFbIKxgdd8pBK4VzP","event":"function_result","name":"read_file","result":{"anchor_sha":"5a859c03871e28e7497015e930eb7d5696cb6258","content":"1: # Hotfix: Move Chat Controller to Fix Auth Layout\n2: \n3: - **Change ID**: `fix-chat-auth-location`\n4: - **Author**: Antigravity (AI)\n5: - **Status**: Proposed\n6: - **Type**: Bugfix\n7: \n8: ## Summary\n9: Move `admin/api/chat_controller.php` to `admin/chat_controller.php` to resolve HTTP 401 Unauthorized errors caused by session cookie path or inclusion context mismatches in the `api/` subdirectory.\n10: \n11: ## Motivation\n12: The frontend `chat.php` is failing to communicate with the controller, receiving constant 401 errors.\n13: This suggests `auth_check.php` logic (which relies on `$_SESSION['user_id']`) works differently or fails when the script is in a subdirectory, possibly due to `session_start()` not seeing the same cookie as the root admin files.\n14: Moving the controller to the same directory as `chat.php` and `dashboard.php` mimics the proven architecture of `lazarus.php` and eliminates this variable.\n15: \n16: ## Scope\n17: - **Move**: `admin/api/chat_controller.php` -> `admin/chat_controller.php`.\n18: - **Refactor**: Update `include` paths in the controller (`../../config.php` -> `../config.php`).\n19: - **Update**: Update `fetch` URLs in `admin/chat.php`.\n20: - **Cleanup**: Remove `admin/api/chat_controller.php`.\n21: \n22: ## Risks\n23: - **Link Breakage**: Any other experimental scripts linking to the old path will break (none known).\n24: - **Security**: The file moves from `api/` (implied public) to `admin/`, which is protected by `.htaccess` (or should be). This is actually safer or neutral.","content_truncated":false,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/abandoned/fix-chat-auth-location/proposal.md","repository":"matheuslyam/crm","returned_lines":[1,24],"sha256":"4a281beef0d990e1e64635744b7ab0065a2e32dc8b2418d6b8c0cdd5d355aa87","status":"found","total_lines":24},"round":3}
